    "signatureIntro": "When the webhook has a signing secret, the body is signed with HMAC-SHA256 and sent as X-ECG-Hub-Signature: sha256=<hex>. Verify it against the raw request body, before any JSON parsing — re-serialising changes the bytes and breaks the comparison.",
    "retryIntro": "Delivery is best-effort: 3 attempts (immediately, +5s, +25s), then the outcome is recorded in the delivery history where it can be replayed. Any 2xx counts as delivered; redirects are not followed. Answer quickly and do the work asynchronously — the sender times out after 10 seconds.",
